# Control player. Waits for the play that matters, then shuts it down.
name: Professor Hollis
title: the Patient
aggression: 0.25
caution: 0.85
patience: 0.9
spending: 0.3
skill: 0.95
decks: stall-burn, modern
intro: Take your time. I certainly will.
win: Class dismissed. Do read the chapter before next time.
lose: A well-earned result. I shall be revising the syllabus.
partner: Two minds, one board. I'll be slow and careful. You be quick.
look: A Black professor in his sixties: close-cropped grey hair and a trimmed grey beard, round wire glasses, a tweed jacket with elbow patches over a green waistcoat, an annotated rulebook under one arm.
ladder: 6   # campaign order (1 = first opponent)
signature: Wave-Motion Cannon   # the first-win gift and the bond 5 gift (CardUnlocks)
# Said during a duel: a big summon, hitting hard, taking a hit, falling to 1000 LP or less.
summon: And now, the point of today's lecture.
strike: Footnote: that damage was entirely avoidable.
hit: Hm. That goes in my notes.
danger: The margins are thin now.
summon: Observe closely. This will be on the exam.
strike: Let the record show: you left that open.
hit: A fair rebuttal. I'll allow it.
danger: Very well. Let's call this a pop quiz.
